      "file": "BankService.java",
      "body": "/** The ATM's only window into the bank. A real implementation would call a remote service. */\npublic interface BankService {\n    boolean isBlocked(Card card);\n\n    PinResult validatePin(Card card, String pin);\n\n    long balance(String accountId);\n\n    /** Atomically debit; returns false (and changes nothing) if funds are insufficient. */\n    boolean debit(String accountId, long amount);\n\n    void credit(String accountId, long amount);\n}\n"
