      "file": "IdleState.java",
      "body": "public class IdleState implements ATMState {\n    private final ATM atm;\n\n    IdleState(ATM atm) {\n        this.atm = atm;\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String name() { return \"idle\"; }\n\n    @Override\n    public void insertCard(Card card) {\n        if (atm.bank().isBlocked(card)) throw new IllegalStateException(\"Card is blocked, contact your bank\");\n        atm.startSession(card);\n        atm.setState(atm.cardInsertedState());\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public void ejectCard() {\n        // Nothing to eject.\n    }\n}\n"
