  "intro": "A large domain, built one requirement at a time on a small core. Profiles use a Builder; connections are a request/accept flow guarded by one lock; the feed delegates ordering to a strategy; jobs reject duplicate applications atomically; and an event bus lets notifications grow without touching the code that raises them. It compiles with plain `javac`, and every output and test result is from a real run, including a 300-round race test for simultaneous cross-requests.",
