      "title": "Requirement 5: Notifications through events",
      "text": "Services never know who is listening: they publish a `DomainEvent` to the `EventBus`. `InAppNotifier` is one listener that keeps an inbox per member; an email or push channel is another listener, and a new event type is a new record. The bus catches listener exceptions, so a broken channel can never break a connection or a job application.",
