    "text": "The driver builds profiles, runs the request, accept, reject and cross-request flows, prints degrees of connection, shows the feed under two ranking strategies, exercises jobs with a rejected duplicate, and prints each member's notification inbox.",
    "file": "Main.java",
    "body": "import java.time.Clock;\nimport java.time.Instant;\nimport java.time.ZoneOffset;\nimport java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicLong;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static Member member(String id, String name, Role role, String headline) {\n        return new Member(id, name, role, Profile.builder().headline(headline).build());\n    }\n\n    static String ordinal(int degree) {\n        return degree == 1 ? \"1st degree\" : degree == 2 ? \"2nd degree\" : \"3rd degree\";\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        EventBus bus = new EventBus();\n        InAppNotifier inApp = new InAppNotifier();\n        bus.subscribe(inApp);\n        ConnectionService connections = new ConnectionService(bus);\n        // A fake clock that ticks one minute per call keeps the output deterministic.\n        AtomicLong tick = new AtomicLong();\n        Clock clock = new Clock() {\n            public java.time.ZoneId getZone() { return ZoneOffset.UTC; }\n            public Clock withZone(java.time.ZoneId zone) { return this; }\n            public Instant instant() { return Instant.parse(\"2026-11-01T09:00:00Z\").plusSeconds(60 * tick.getAndIncrement()); }\n        };\n        FeedService feed = new FeedService(connections, clock, new RecentFirst());\n        JobBoard jobs = new JobBoard(bus);\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Requirement 1: profiles (Builder) ---\");\n        Profile asha = Profile.builder()\n            .headline(\"Backend engineer\")\n            .experience(new Experience(\"Acme\", \"Engineer\", 2021, null))\n            .skill(\"Java\").skill(\"Distributed Systems\").build();\n        Member ashaM = new Member(\"m1\", \"Asha\", Role.MEMBER, asha);\n        Member ben = member(\"m2\", \"Ben\", Role.MEMBER, \"Data scientist\");\n        Member chitra = member(\"m3\", \"Chitra\", Role.MEMBER, \"Designer\");\n        Member dev = member(\"m4\", \"Dev\", Role.MEMBER, \"SRE\");\n        Member eli = member(\"m5\", \"Eli\", Role.MEMBER, \"PM\");\n        Member rita = member(\"r1\", \"Rita\", Role.RECRUITER, \"Talent partner at Globex\");\n        System.out.println(ashaM + \": \" + asha.headline() + \", skills \" + asha.skills() + \", current role: \" + asha.experience().get(0).title());\n        try { Profile.builder().build(); } catch (IllegalStateException e) { System.out.println(\"rejected: \" + e.getMessage()); }\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Requirement 2: connection requests ---\");\n        ConnectionRequest r1 = connections.send(ashaM, ben);\n        connections.accept(r1.id(), ben);\n        System.out.println(\"Asha-Ben connected: \" + connections.areConnected(ashaM, ben) + \" (mutual: \" + connections.areConnected(ben, ashaM) + \")\");\n        ConnectionRequest r2 = connections.send(ashaM, chitra);\n        connections.reject(r2.id(), chitra);\n        System.out.println(\"Asha-Chitra connected: \" + connections.areConnected(ashaM, chitra));\n        connections.send(ben, dev);\n        connections.send(dev, ben); // cross request: merged into one connection\n        System.out.println(\"Ben-Dev connected after cross requests: \" + connections.areConnected(ben, dev));\n        connections.accept(connections.send(dev, eli).id(), eli);\n        try { connections.send(ashaM, ben); } catch (IllegalStateException e) { System.out.println(\"rejected: \" + e.getMessage()); }\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Degree of connection from Asha ---\");\n        for (Member m : new Member[] {ben, dev, eli, chitra}) {\n            System.out.println(m + \": \" + connections.degree(ashaM, m).stream().mapToObj(Main::ordinal).findFirst().orElse(\"not within 3 degrees\"));\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Requirement 3: posts and feed ---\");\n        Post p1 = feed.publish(ben, \"Our model is live\");\n        Post p2 = feed.publish(ben, \"Hiring a data engineer\");\n        feed.publish(chitra, \"Not connected, so invisible to Asha\");\n        p1.like(ashaM);\n        p1.like(dev);\n        System.out.println(\"Recent first:\");\n        feed.feed(ashaM, 10).forEach(p -> System.out.println(\"  \" + p));\n        feed.setStrategy(new EngagementFirst());\n        System.out.println(\"Engagement first (same FeedService, new strategy):\");\n        feed.feed(ashaM, 10).forEach(p -> System.out.println(\"  \" + p));\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Requirement 4: jobs ---\");\n        JobPosting job = jobs.post(rita, \"Backend Engineer\", \"Globex\");\n        jobs.apply(ashaM, job.id(), \"Excited to apply\");\n        try { jobs.apply(ashaM, job.id(), \"again\"); } catch (IllegalStateException e) { System.out.println(\"rejected: \" + e.getMessage()); }\n        try { jobs.post(ben, \"Fake job\", \"X\"); } catch (IllegalStateException e) { System.out.println(\"rejected: \" + e.getMessage()); }\n        System.out.println(\"Rita sees: \" + jobs.applicationsFor(rita, job.id()).stream().map(a -> a.applicant().name()).toList());\n        try { jobs.applicationsFor(ben, job.id()); } catch (IllegalStateException e) { System.out.println(\"rejected: \" + e.getMessage()); }\n\n        System.out.println(\"--- Notifications (extensibility: events) ---\");\n        System.out.println(\"Ben:   \" + inApp.inboxOf(ben));\n        System.out.println(\"Asha:  \" + inApp.inboxOf(ashaM));\n        System.out.println(\"Rita:  \" + inApp.inboxOf(rita));\n    }\n}\n",
